      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broadalbin%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Broadalbin sits on the eastern edge of Fulton County, just south of Great Sacandaga Lake and within Adirondack Park.",
